Changes:
 edulution-fileproxy (1.6.0) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Release of 1.6.0~rc2, which was tested on an existing installation.
   * Depend on edulution-archive-keyring 2026.11.18 or later, which holds the
     next repository signing key next to the current one, so a host that
     already has an earlier keyring also gets it with this upgrade.
   * The entries for 1.6.0~rc2 and 1.6.0~rc1 below list everything else that
     changed since 1.5.0.
